1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
Little Moments.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,375
The Group Project Problem.

3
00:00:03,375 --> 00:00:06,323
Emma and I are making a poster about our neighborhood.

4
00:00:06,323 --> 00:00:09,802
Yesterday, we both thought the other person was bringing the pictures.

5
00:00:09,802 --> 00:00:12,792
Today, we have a beautiful blank sheet of paper.

6
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:14,606
What have we finished so far?

7
00:00:14,884 --> 00:00:16,107
The title.

8
00:00:16,107 --> 00:00:18,211
And I brought a very nice marker.

9
00:00:18,434 --> 00:00:19,103
Great.

10
00:00:19,103 --> 00:00:21,926
At this speed, we'll finish by the time we're eighty.

11
00:00:22,204 --> 00:00:23,948
Let's make a simple plan.

12
00:00:23,948 --> 00:00:26,646
I open my notebook and draw two columns.

13
00:00:26,646 --> 00:00:31,427
We need pictures, short descriptions, a map, and a little time to put everything together.

14
00:00:31,658 --> 00:00:32,879
I can draw the map.

15
00:00:32,879 --> 00:00:34,681
I actually like drawing maps.

16
00:00:34,681 --> 00:00:36,223
Could you handle the pictures?

17
00:00:36,508 --> 00:00:37,668
Sure.

18
00:00:37,668 --> 00:00:40,616
I've already taken photos of the park and the library.

19
00:00:40,616 --> 00:00:42,335
I can print them tonight.

20
00:00:42,335 --> 00:00:46,658
We each choose two places to write about, then agree to bring everything tomorrow.

21
00:00:46,924 --> 00:00:49,114
How's the project going over here?

22
00:00:49,298 --> 00:00:50,394
Much better now.

23
00:00:50,394 --> 00:00:54,467
We finally gave the jobs to actual people instead of hoping they would do themselves.

24
00:00:54,748 --> 00:00:56,481
That's usually helpful.

25
00:00:56,481 --> 00:00:59,585
Leave time to check the whole poster before you hand it in.

26
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:03,385
The next day, Emma brings the map, and I bring the pictures.

27
00:01:03,385 --> 00:01:06,031
We lay everything out before we start gluing.

28
00:01:06,031 --> 00:01:09,750
One picture is upside down, and one street has an extra letter.

29
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:11,302
We fix both.

30
00:01:11,522 --> 00:01:12,409
Look at that.

31
00:01:12,409 --> 00:01:13,566
A real poster.

32
00:01:13,852 --> 00:01:15,752
And we're nowhere near eighty.

33
00:01:15,752 --> 00:01:18,617
I put a check beside every job on our list.

34
00:01:18,617 --> 00:01:21,669
Even the nice marker finally gets something useful to do.
